<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Egocrypto - Login</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4"></script>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <style>
        body { background-color: #0B0E14; color: #ffffff; font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif; }
        .ai-badge { border: 1.5px solid #FACC15; border-radius: 30px; padding: 8px 18px; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1px; color: #ffffff; display: inline-block; }
        .hero-title { font-size: 44px; font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.1; }
        .btn-primary { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4F46E5, #06B6D4); border-radius: 30px; color: #ffffff; font-weight: bold; font-size: 16px; transition: transform 0.15s; }
        .btn-outline-yellow { border: 1.5px solid #FACC15; border-radius: 30px; color: #FACC15; font-weight: bold; font-size: 16px; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.1); transition: transform 0.15s; }
        .grid-item { background: rgba(22,32,50,0.8); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 16px; padding: 18px 12px; text-align: center; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.5px; color: #ffffff; }
        .feature-card { background: #1B212C; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); border-radius: 16px; padding: 20px; }
        .feature-title { color: #FACC15; font-size: 14px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 0.8px; text-transform: uppercase; }
        .feature-desc { color: #94A3B8; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px; }
        /* ===== LOGIN STYLES (WHITE INPUTS) ===== */
        .auth-container { background-color: #1C212E; border-radius: 24px; padding: 32px 24px; max-width: 420px; width: 100%; box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.5); }
        .auth-title { font-size: 28px; font-weight: 600; color: #ffffff; margin-bottom: 4px; }
        .auth-subtitle { color: #9CA3AF; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 24px; }
        .auth-label { color: #A3A8B8; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.5px; text-transform: uppercase; display: block; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 14px; }
        .auth-input { background-color: #F3F4F6; border: 1px solid #E5E7EB; border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; color: #111827; width: 100%; font-size: 15px; transition: 0.2s; outline: none; }
        .auth-input:focus { border-color: #3B82F6; box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.2); }
        .auth-input::placeholder { color: #9CA3AF; }
        .auth-btn-gradient { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2563EB, #3B82F6); border-radius: 12px; color: #ffffff; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; padding: 14px; width: 100%; text-align: center; border: none; cursor: pointer; transition: 0.2s; }
        .auth-btn-gradient:hover { opacity: 0.9; }
        .show-password-btn-login { background-color: #E5E7EB; border-radius: 6px; color: #4B5563; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; padding: 4px 12px; border: none; cursor: pointer; transition: 0.2s; }
        .show-password-btn-login:hover { background-color: #D1D5DB; }
        .forgot-password { color: #FACC15; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; }
        .forgot-password:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
        /* ===== REGISTER STYLES (DARK THEME) ===== */
        .reg-container { background-color: #141824; border-radius: 24px; padding: 24px 20px; max-width: 420px; width: 100%; box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.5); }
        .reg-title { font-size: 26px; font-weight: 600; color: #ffffff; margin-bottom: 2px; }
        .reg-subtitle { color: #9CA3AF; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 20px; }
        .reg-label { color: #A3A8B8; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.5px; text-transform: uppercase; display: block; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 12px; }
        .reg-input { background-color: #10121C; border: 1px solid #29304B; border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; color: #ffffff; width: 100%; font-size: 14px; transition: 0.2s; outline: none; }
        .reg-input:focus { border-color: #3B82F6; box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.2); }
        .reg-input::placeholder { color: #5A627A; }
        .show-password-btn-reg { background-color: #1F2533; border-radius: 8px; color: #ffffff; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; padding: 6px 14px; border: none; cursor: pointer; transition: 0.2s; }
        .show-password-btn-reg:hover { background-color: #2C3443; }
        .btn-back-login { background-color: #1F2533; border-radius: 12px; color: #ffffff; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; padding: 14px; width: 100%; text-align: center; border: none; cursor: pointer; transition: 0.2s; }
        .btn-back-login:hover { background-color: #2C3443; }
        #dropdown-menu { animation: fadeIn 0.15s ease-out; }
        @keyframes fadeIn { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-5px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); } }
        /* Letter Bounce Animation */
        .bounce-letter { display: inline-block; animation: bounceIn 0.8s ease-out forwards; opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px); }
        .bounce-letter.white { color: #ffffff; }           /* အဖြူရောင် */
        .bounce-letter.teal { color: #00D09C; }            /* အစိမ်းရောင် */
        .bounce-letter.yellow { color: #FACC15; }          /* အဝါရောင် */
        @keyframes bounceIn {
            0% { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px) scale(0.8); }
            50% { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(-10px) scale(1.05); }
            70% { transform: translateY(3px) scale(0.98); }
            100% { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0) scale(1); }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="antialiased">
    <!-- Flash Messages -->
    {% with messages = get_flashed_messages(with_categories=true) %}
        {% if messages %}
            <div class="px-4 pt-4 space-y-2">
                {% for category, message in messages %}
                    <div class="{{ 'bg-emerald-500/10 border border-emerald-500/30 text-emerald-400' if category == 'success' else 'bg-red-500/10 border border-red-500/30 text-red-400' }} px-4 py-3 rounded-xl text-sm font-medium text-center">
                        {{ message }}
                    </div>
                {% endfor %}
            </div>
        {% endif %}
    {% endwith %}
    <!-- ============================== -->
    <!-- 1. Hero/Landing View           -->
    <!-- ============================== -->
    <div id="hero-view" class="min-h-screen flex flex-col">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between px-5 py-4">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-gradient-to-tr from-purple-600 to-blue-600 flex items-center justify-center">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-chart-line text-white text-sm"></i>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <div class="text-white font-bold text-lg tracking-wide">Egocrypto</div>
                    <div class="text-yellow-400 text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-widest">COIN</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="relative">
                <button onclick="toggleDropdown()" class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-gray-800/60 flex items-center justify-center focus:outline-none">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-bars text-white text-xl"></i>
                </button>
                <div id="dropdown-menu" class="hidden absolute right-0 mt-2 w-48 bg-[#1B212C] border border-gray-700 rounded-xl shadow-2xl z-50 overflow-hidden">
                    <button onclick="selectMenu('about')" class="w-full text-left px-4 py-3 text-white hover:bg-gray-800/50 transition text-sm"><i class="fa-solid fa-info-circle mr-2 text-gray-400"></i>About us</button>
                    <button onclick="selectMenu('agreement')" class="w-full text-left px-4 py-3 text-white hover:bg-gray-800/50 transition text-sm"><i class="fa-solid fa-file-contract mr-2 text-gray-400"></i>User agreement</button>
                    <button onclick="selectMenu('login')" class="w-full text-left px-4 py-3 text-white hover:bg-gray-800/50 transition text-sm"><i class="fa-solid fa-right-to-bracket mr-2 text-gray-400"></i>Sign up / Login</button>
                    <button onclick="window.location.href='/support'" class="w-full text-left px-4 py-3 text-white hover:bg-gray-800/50 transition text-sm"><i class="fa-solid fa-headset mr-2 text-gray-400"></i>Customer Service</button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex-1 flex flex-col items-center justify-center px-5 pt-28 pb-10">
            <span class="ai-badge">AI POWERED SECURE FUTURE READY</span>
            <h1 id="animated-title" class="hero-title mt-8"></h1>
            <p class="text-gray-400 text-[15px] leading-7 mt-6 max-w-sm text-center">Harness the power of AI and blockchain analytics to investigate eligible recovery opportunities efficiently, securely, and professionally.</p>
            <div class="w-full max-w-sm mt-8 space-y-3">
                <button onclick="showRegister()" class="btn-primary w-full py-4">Create account</button>
                <button onclick="showLogin()" class="btn-outline-yellow w-full py-4">Login</button>
            </div>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 mt-10 w-full max-w-sm">
                <div class="grid-item">AI POWERED</div>
                <div class="grid-item">SECURE VAULTS</div>
                <div class="grid-item">FUTURE READY</div>
                <div class="grid-item">VIP ACCESS</div>
            </div>
            <div class="w-full max-w-sm text-left mt-14">
                <h2 class="text-white font-bold text-[22px] leading-tight">Built for a faster premium crypto experience.</h2>
                <div class="space-y-4 mt-6">
                    <div class="feature-card"><div class="feature-title">VAULT</div><div class="feature-desc">Unlock VIP tier access with plan-based rewards and live vault value tracking.</div></div>
                    <div class="feature-card"><div class="feature-title">AI MINING</div><div class="feature-desc">Follow a guided mining flow with clean confirmations and reward visibility.</div></div>
                    <div class="feature-card"><div class="feature-title">SECURE WALLET</div><div class="feature-desc">Keep balances, deposits, and purchase states clear across the platform.</div></div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <!-- ============================== -->
    <!-- 2. About Us View               -->
    <!-- ============================== -->
    <div id="about-view" class="hidden min-h-screen bg-[#F0F5FA] text-gray-900 py-6">
        <div class="max-w-md mx-auto px-4">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-6">
                <button onclick="showHero()" class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-white shadow flex items-center justify-center text-gray-700"><i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-left"></i></button>
                <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-800">About Egocrypto</h2>
                <div class="w-10"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-6 shadow-sm">
                <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">About Egocrypto</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-800 text-[16px] leading-7 mb-4">Egocrypto is a trading platform designed to deliver clarity, speed, and confidence to users across all experience levels.</p>
                <div class="bg-[#E3EEF9] rounded-2xl p-5 mb-6">
                    <p class="text-[#1E3A8A] text-[15px] leading-7 font-medium">Egocrypto was established to address a common gap in the market: platforms are often either overly complex or overly simplified. Our objective is to provide a balanced experience—clean design, effective tools, and transparent communication.</p>
                </div>
                <h4 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">Our Principles</h4>
                <ul class="text-gray-800 text-[16px] leading-7 list-disc pl-5 mb-4 space-y-1">
                    <li>Trading should be accessible and understandable.</li>
                    <li>Risk disclosure must be clear and honest.</li>
                    <li>Tools should be efficient without unnecessary complexity.</li>
                    <li>Security and reliability are foundational.</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <!-- ============================== -->
    <!-- 3. Agreement View              -->
    <!-- ============================== -->
    <div id="agreement-view" class="hidden min-h-screen bg-[#F0F5FA] text-gray-900 py-6">
        <div class="max-w-md mx-auto px-4">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-6">
                <button onclick="showHero()" class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-white shadow flex items-center justify-center text-gray-700"><i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-left"></i></button>
                <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-800">Egocrypto USER AGREEMENT</h2>
                <div class="w-10"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-6 shadow-sm">
                <div class="text-xs text-gray-500 mb-4">Effective Date: 10/12/2025 · Platform Name: Egocrypto</div>
                <p class="text-gray-800 text-[16px] leading-7 mb-4">This User Agreement ("Agreement") is a legally binding contract between you ("User") and Egocrypto ("Company", "We", "Us", or "Our"). By creating an account or using our crypto-related services, you agree to the following terms and conditions.</p>
                <h4 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2 mt-4">1. Eligibility</h4>
                <ul class="text-gray-800 text-[16px] leading-7 list-disc pl-5 mb-4 space-y-1">
                    <li>You must be at least 18 years old.</li>
                    <li>You must have full legal capacity to enter into this Agreement.</li>
                    <li>You confirm that cryptocurrency use and trading is legal in your country of residence.</li>
                </ul>
                <h4 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">2. Account Registration</h4>
                <ul class="text-gray-800 text-[16px] leading-7 list-disc pl-5 mb-4 space-y-1">
                    <li>You agree to provide accurate, current, and complete information.</li>
                    <li>You are responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of your account credentials.</li>
                    <li>All activities conducted under your account are your responsibility.</li>
                </ul>
                <h4 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">3. Risk Disclosure</h4>
                <p class="text-gray-800 text-[16px] leading-7 mb-2">Cryptocurrency activities involve high risk, including but not limited to:</p>
                <ul class="text-gray-800 text-[16px] leading-7 list-disc pl-5 mb-4 space-y-1">
                    <li>Extreme market volatility</li>
                    <li>Regulatory uncertainty</li>
                    <li>Technical risks</li>
                    <li>Total loss of funds</li>
                </ul>
                <p class="text-gray-800 text-[16px] leading-7 mb-4">By using Egocrypto, you acknowledge that:</p>
                <ul class="text-gray-800 text-[16px] leading-7 list-disc pl-5 mb-4 space-y-1">
                    <li>You understand these risks.</li>
                    <li>You accept full responsibility for your decisions.</li>
                    <li>Egocrypto does not guarantee profits or returns.</li>
                </ul>
                <h4 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">4. Deposits and Withdrawals</h4>
                <ul class="text-gray-800 text-[16px] leading-7 list-disc pl-5 mb-4 space-y-1">
                    <li>Users are responsible for verifying wallet addresses before transactions.</li>
                    <li>Blockchain transactions are irreversible.</li>
                    <li>Egocrypto is not responsible for losses due to incorrect transfers or user error.</li>
                </ul>
                <h4 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">5. Fees</h4>
                <ul class="text-gray-800 text-[16px] leading-7 list-disc pl-5 mb-4 space-y-1">
                    <li>Egocrypto may charge service, trading, or withdrawal fees.</li>
                    <li>All applicable fees will be displayed before transaction confirmation.</li>
                </ul>
                <h4 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">6. Prohibited Activities</h4>
                <p class="text-gray-800 text-[16px] leading-7 mb-2">Users must NOT:</p>
                <ul class="text-gray-800 text-[16px] leading-7 list-disc pl-5 mb-4 space-y-1">
                    <li>Engage in illegal activities including money laundering</li>
                    <li>Use stolen funds</li>
                    <li>Attempt to hack or exploit the platform</li>
                    <li>Manipulate markets</li>
                    <li>Violate any applicable laws or regulations</li>
                </ul>
                <p class="text-gray-800 text-[16px] leading-7 mb-4">Violation may result in immediate suspension or termination.</p>
                <h4 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">7. Security</h4>
                <p class="text-gray-800 text-[16px] leading-7 mb-2">While Egocrypto implements reasonable security measures, we cannot guarantee absolute protection against:</p>
                <ul class="text-gray-800 text-[16px] leading-7 list-disc pl-5 mb-4 space-y-1">
                    <li>Cyber attacks</li>
                    <li>System failures</li>
                    <li>Third-party service disruptions</li>
                </ul>
                <p class="text-gray-800 text-[16px] leading-7 mb-4">Users are strongly encouraged to enable two-factor authentication (2FA).</p>
                <h4 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">8. Limitation of Liability</h4>
                <p class="text-gray-800 text-[16px] leading-7 mb-2">Egocrypto shall not be liable for:</p>
                <ul class="text-gray-800 text-[16px] leading-7 list-disc pl-5 mb-4 space-y-1">
                    <li>Market losses</li>
                    <li>Trading errors</li>
                    <li>Service interruptions</li>
                    <li>Losses resulting from user negligence</li>
                </ul>
                <p class="text-gray-800 text-[16px] leading-7 mb-4">All services are provided "as is" and "at your own risk."</p>
                <h4 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">9. Termination</h4>
                <p class="text-gray-800 text-[16px] leading-7 mb-4">Egocrypto reserves the right to suspend, restrict, or terminate any account at its discretion or as required by law.</p>
                <h4 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">10. Amendments</h4>
