                <h4 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">11. Governing Law</h4>
                <p class="text-gray-800 text-[16px] leading-7 mb-4">This Agreement shall be governed by the laws of: United States</p>
                <h4 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">12. Contact Information</h4>
                <ul class="text-gray-800 text-[16px] leading-7 list-disc pl-5 mb-4 space-y-1">
                    <li><strong>Company Name:</strong> Egocrypto</li>
                    <li><strong>Email:</strong> opendexpro.us@gmail.com</li>
                    <li><strong>Website:</strong> www.opendexpro.com</li>
                </ul>
                <h4 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">13. Withdrawal Policy</h4>
                <h5 class="text-md font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-1">13.1 Withdrawal Processing Time</h5>
                <p class="text-gray-800 text-[16px] leading-7 mb-4">All withdrawal requests must be formally submitted through the Egocrypto platform. Once a withdrawal request is approved, processing may take 7–10 business days before funds are released. Processing time may vary depending on compliance review, security verification, and network conditions.</p>
                <h5 class="text-md font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-1">13.2 Withdrawal Fees</h5>
                <ul class="text-gray-800 text-[16px] leading-7 list-disc pl-5 mb-4 space-y-1">
                    <li>Withdrawal fees may apply.</li>
                    <li>Fees may vary depending on the user’s account size, profit level, and total returns.</li>
                    <li>Applicable fees will be communicated before final withdrawal confirmation.</li>
                    <li>Egocrypto reserves the right to adjust withdrawal fee structures at its discretion.</li>
                </ul>
                <h5 class="text-md font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-1">13.3 Network Fees and Advance Payment</h5>
                <ul class="text-gray-800 text-[16px] leading-7 list-disc pl-5 mb-4 space-y-1">
                    <li>Blockchain network fees and withdrawal service fees must be paid in advance before funds are released.</li>
                    <li>Failure to complete required fee payments may result in delays or cancellation of the withdrawal request.</li>
                    <li>This policy is implemented as part of Egocrypto’s fraud prevention and security procedures.</li>
                </ul>
                <h5 class="text-md font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-1">13.4 Withdrawal Charge Confirmation</h5>
                <ul class="text-gray-800 text-[16px] leading-7 list-disc pl-5 mb-4 space-y-1">
                    <li>Users must contact official Egocrypto Customer Support to confirm applicable withdrawal charges based on their account size.</li>
                    <li>Withdrawal fees are determined according to internal risk management and account classification policies.</li>
                </ul>
                <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-6">Last updated: 10/12/2025</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <!-- ============================== -->
    <!-- 4. LOGIN VIEW                  -->
    <!-- ============================== -->
    <div id="login-view" class="hidden min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center px-4 py-6">
        <div class="auth-container">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2">
                <h2 class="auth-title">Login</h2>
                <button onclick="showHero()" class="text-gray-400 hover:text-white"><i class="fa-solid fa-xmark text-2xl"></i></button>
            </div>
            <p class="auth-subtitle">Welcome back to Egocrypto.</p>
            <form method="POST" action="/login" class="space-y-2">
                <div>
                    <label class="auth-label">Username</label>
                    <input type="text" name="username" required class="auth-input" placeholder="Enter username">
                </div>
                <div>
                    <label class="auth-label">Password</label>
                    <div class="relative">
                        <input type="password" id="login-password" name="password" required class="auth-input pr-[70px]" placeholder="••••••••">
                        <button type="button" onclick="togglePassword('login-password', this)" class="show-password-btn-login absolute right-2 top-2.5">Show</button>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="flex justify-end mt-1 mb-4">
                    <a href="#" class="forgot-password">Forgot password?</a>
                </div>
                <button type="submit" class="auth-btn-gradient">Login</button>
            </form>
            <p class="text-center text-gray-400 text-sm mt-4">
                If you don't have an account, <button onclick="showRegister()" class="text-yellow-400 font-semibold hover:underline">create account</button>.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
    <!-- ============================== -->
    <!-- 5. REGISTER VIEW               -->
    <!-- ============================== -->
    <div id="register-view" class="hidden min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center px-4 py-6">
        <div class="reg-container">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-1">
                <h2 class="reg-title">Create your account</h2>
                <button onclick="showHero()" class="text-gray-400 hover:text-white"><i class="fa-solid fa-xmark text-xl"></i></button>
            </div>
            <p class="reg-subtitle">Sign up to get started with Egocrypto.</p>
            <form id="registerForm" method="POST" action="/register" onsubmit="return validateRegister()" class="space-y-1">
                <div>
                    <label class="reg-label">Country</label>
                    <select name="country" id="countrySelect" onchange="updateCountryCode()" class="reg-input appearance-none bg-[#10121C] text-white border border-[#29304B]">
                    </select>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <label class="reg-label">Phone Number</label>
                    <div class="flex items-end gap-3 mb-0.5">
                        <div id="phone-prefix" class="w-16 bg-[#10121C] rounded-xl py-3 text-white text-sm border border-[#29304B] text-center font-medium">+1</div>
                        <input type="tel" name="phone" class="reg-input flex-1" placeholder="Phone number" required>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <label class="reg-label">Email</label>
                    <input type="email" name="email" id="reg-email" class="reg-input" placeholder="you@email.com" required>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <label class="reg-label">Username</label>
                    <input type="text" name="username" class="reg-input" placeholder="your username" required>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <label class="reg-label">Password</label>
                    <div class="relative">
                        <input type="password" id="reg-password" name="password" class="reg-input pr-[75px]" placeholder="......" required>
